                "title": "Circulaire Knobset with Arc Rose",
                "description": "The Circulaire Knobset with Arc Rose has a familiar, traditional silhouette that is reminiscent of stately homes in elite neighborhoods. Its quiet style is subtle, a perfect compliment to any transitional decor styled house. The Arc Rose with Circulaire Knob is available in all the most popular finish colors. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions.",
